OL,3,ACapita shares plunge and boss steps
OL,4,Adown as civil service pensions saga
OL,5,Adrags on
OL,6,
OL,7,FShares in outsourcing business Capita
OL,8,Fhave sunk 70% after its boss stepped
OL,9,Fdown as the saga over public sector
OL,10,Fpensions drags on.
OL,12,FChief executive Adolfo Hernandez has
OL,13,Fagreed with the firm's board to leave
OL,14,Fwith "immediate effect", admitting that
OL,15,Fthe company had "not delivered" for
OL,16,Fmembers of the UK's Civil Service
OL,17,Fpension scheme.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
