OL,3,ACapita shares plunge and boss steps
OL,4,Adown as civil service pensions saga
OL,5,Adrags on
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe scheme, which manages the pensions
OL,8,Fof 1.7 million public sector workers in
OL,9,Fthe UK, has been mired in controversy,
OL,10,Fwith tens of thousands of retiring
OL,11,Fcivil servants having faced delays
OL,12,Freceiving their pension payments.
OL,14,FCapita has cut its profit forecast,
OL,15,Fpartly due to the problems surrounding
OL,16,Fthe scheme, and says it plans to raise
OL,17,F#190m to bolster its finances.
